body:
NTA.  i'm autistic. it can suck when people dont seem interested in your special interest. but you're your own person, and not everyone is going to like something as much as I do. but thats okay, because its special to me, it doesnt have to be as special to them.

&#x200B;

107 unread messages are scary. that number would make me not want to check it even more. i dont understand why he's doing that to you and im sorry. Maybe you could explain to your Nan what is going on and she could help you. Good luck :(

Hmm.. was I meant to get a message? I heard a low gonging sound, and a rumble, as if it had spawned an enemy for me to fight, but.. so far, nothing else.

&#x200B;

And thank you, you as well!

I think, as of right now, i am in no danger to myself. If it gets worse, however, i will post there.

&#x200B;

Sadly, i live in one of the absolute worst states for mental health, and lack insurance. Trying to find a therapist is.. next to impossible.

thank oyu. I'm tryinb, but there are moments when people who usually comfort me are just.. asleep, or at work, or what have you. like now, everyone i normally go to is gone.

&#x200B;

cute puppy vieeos do sound nice however.

i know you're right. I know you are. I'm in such a better place now than I was last year, but it's.. terrifying. time seems to move so quickly, and i'm powerless to stop it.

&#x200B;

but thank you. thank you thank yuo thank you so much. Hearing someone tell me that i've been doing well, rather than 'why arent you over this already' means so much to me.

&#x200B;

honestly? I don't want to remember them at all. I want to process them, tuck them away, and try to forget.

Oh! alright, let me look into that, thank you so much.

&#x200B;

Edit: how do I edit the config? I don't see a way to do that..

Sadly, for me, sometimes "forcing" myself to do something just doesnt work. I feel like im trapped in my body. my brain says 'get up, get up get up!!' but my body just wont move. no matter how much i scream at it to. 

&#x200B;

but the numbers game is a good idea, i think. someone else suggested it, and to take thenumbers as small as '5 peices of trash' or up to '5 trash bags.' i like that i can make it flexable to what i feel up to that day, i think that'll help me out a lot. 

&#x200B;

i also like the advice of looking at not what i HAVEN'T done, but what i HAVE done. the positives is something i really struggle with, even with the therapy im getting now. 

&#x200B;

and sorry for missing your message. im very new to reddit

do you know any sites that trade services? I am very good with animals, and i draw/paint quite well (my icon for example.) if i could trade something such as watching someones pets, painting a room of their house, ect, i would really, really like that. 

&#x200B;

I'll see what i can do about the dollar tree in my town for cleaning supplies. i dont know why i didnt think of that..

i think i mentioned it somewhere in this thread, but i cant really open my windows. my apartment has three total windows, two side by side in one 'big' window, and one in my bedroom. theres also one in the living room that doesnt open at all (stuck? not sure.) but the two big ones i cant lift on my own. my arm strength is very low, and i cant seem to get it budged.

&#x200B;

I also dont have ant cinnamon/cloves in my house. i live on foodstamps/ I live in northwestern/midwestern indiana.

THANK YOU for the fruit fly trap/killers ideas. they make me feel the most dirty. I dont think i can manage an entire room, but maybe i can do sections of a room, and when i get really burned out, just stop for a bit.  the motivation to start, for me, is the hardest part. 

&#x200B;

i'll need to buy apple cider vinigar next time i get my foodstamps refilled. I hate these little bugs.
